 R←Test_Pause_005(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise "Pause" with automation: "*" suppresses every call even when there are other "Pause" rows
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 C.AddAutomation'Pause' 'TST1@' ''
 C.AddAutomation'Pause' 'Should not stop -1-' ''
 C.AddAutomation'Pause' '*' ''
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠C.Pause'TST1@Should not stop -2-'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠C.Pause'Should not stop -1-'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠C.Pause'TST2@Matches no row but must not stop either'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠C.Pause'Matches no row and has no alias'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1 1 2≢C.∆Automation[;4]

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 C.Cleanup
⍝Done
